diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 4469b86..e3ec30a 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -60,3 +60,28 @@ Marks all unread notifications as read.
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `PUT /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Updates how often you get email bundles of your unread notifications. Instead of one email per notification, notifications are collected into a time window that starts with the first notification, and one email is sent when the window ends.
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "user_settings": {
+    "bundle_email_frequency": "daily"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+`bundle_email_frequency` is one of:
+
+- `never` (default): no notification emails
+- `every_few_hours`: one email every 4 hours
+- `daily`: one email a day
+- `weekly`: one email a week
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success, or `422 Unprocessable Entity` for an unknown frequency.
